(240, 1, '2025-03-10 18:31:16', '2025-03-10 21:31:16', 'Front End developer with over 15 years of professional experience, based in Aracaju/SE. Vasco\'s fan, from Bahia and brazilian from heart.\n\nBorn and brought up in Itabuna city in South Bahia. When I was a kid, I always wanted be an engineer, but sometimes had the thought to be a veterinarian. My mother had the desire for me be a nurse, and I have tried to study economy, manager and math. But my mind will always drag me in having an interest to study computer science while in University.\n\nIn April 2010, I graduated in Information Systems and moved to Rio de Janeiro and I started to work for ZONAInternet agency. At ZONAInternet I worked with the Front End team until November 2012.\n\nFrom December 2012 until October 2020, I had a great time working at CENPES/Petrobras as Front End development.\n\nI really enjoyed working as a remote developer at LAMCSO/COPPE/UFRJ from November 2020 to March 2025.\n\nIn my current days, I live  in Aracaju/SE and my new set goals are at LCCV/UFAL as a remote Developer with the development team.', 'About Me', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '9-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-10 18:31:16', '2025-03-10 21:31:16', '', 9, 'http://localhost:8080/portfolio/wordpress/?p=240', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(241, 1, '2025-03-12 10:09:36', '2025-03-12 13:09:36', 'Front End developer with over 15 years of professional experience, based in Aracaju/SE. Vasco\'s fan, from Bahia and brazilian from heart.\n\nBorn and brought up in Itabuna city in South Bahia. When I was a kid, I always wanted be an engineer, but sometimes had the thought to be a veterinarian. My mother had the desire for me be a nurse, and I have tried to study economy, manager and math. But my mind will always drag me in having an interest to study computer science while in University.\n\nIn April 2010, I graduated in Information Systems and moved to Rio de Janeiro and I started to work for ZONAInternet agency. At ZONAInternet I worked with the Front End team until November 2012.\n\nFrom December 2012 to October 2020, I had a great experience working as a Front-End Developer at CENPES/Petrobras. After that, from November 2020 to March 2025, I thoroughly enjoyed working remotely as a developer at LAMCSO/COPPE/UFRJ.\n\nIn my current days, I live  in Aracaju/SE and my new set goals are at LCCV/UFAL as a remote Developer with the development team.', 'About Me', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '9-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-12 10:09:36', '2025-03-12 13:09:36', '', 9, 'http://localhost:8080/portfolio/wordpress/?p=241', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(243, 1, '2025-03-12 11:28:09', '2025-03-12 14:28:09', 'Front End developer with over 15 years of professional experience, based in Aracaju/SE. Vasco\'s fan, from Bahia and brazilian from heart.\n\nI was born and raised in Itabuna, a city in Bahia. When I were a child, I always dreamed of becoming an civil engineer, though I occasionally considered becoming a veterinarian. My mother wished for me to pursue a career in nursing, and over time, I thought about study in economics, management, or mathematics. However, my passion alwayes computer science, which I ultimately chose to study at university.\n\nIn April 2010, I graduated in Information Systems and moved to Rio de Janeiro and I worked at ZONAInternet agency as Front End Developer until November 2012.\n\nFrom December 2012 to October 2020, I had a great experience working as a Front End Developer at CENPES/Petrobras. After that, from November 2020 to March 2025, I thoroughly enjoyed working remotely as a developer at LAMCSO/COPPE/UFRJ.\n\nIn my current days, I live  in Aracaju/SE and my new set goals are at LCCV/UFAL as a remote Developer with the development team.', 'About Me', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '9-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-12 11:28:09', '2025-03-12 14:28:09', '', 9, 'http://localhost:8080/portfolio/wordpress/?p=243', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(244, 1, '2025-03-12 13:01:32', '2025-03-12 16:01:32', 'Hi,\n<h2>I\'m Jadson Santos</h2>\n<h1>Front End Developer</h1>\n<small>Talking with UX Designers, Back End Developers and Users.</small>', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '7-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-12 13:01:32', '2025-03-12 16:01:32', '', 7, 'http://localhost:8080/portfolio/wordpress/?p=244', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(246, 1, '2025-03-18 16:22:26', '2025-03-18 19:22:26', 'Front End developer with over 15 years of professional experience, based in Aracaju/SE. Vasco\'s fan, from Bahia and brazilian from heart.\n\nI was born and raised in Itabuna, a city in Bahia. When I were a child, I always dreamed of becoming an civil engineer, though I occasionally considered becoming a veterinarian. My mother wished for me to pursue a career in nursing, and over time, I thought about study in economics, management, or mathematics. However, my passion alwayes computer science, which I ultimately chose to study at university.\n\nIn April 2010, I graduated in Information Systems and moved to Rio de Janeiro and I worked at ZONAInternet agency as Front End Developer until November 2012.\n\nFrom December 2012 to October 2020, I had a great experience working as a Front End Developer at CENPES/Petrobras. After that, from November 2020 to March 2025, I thoroughly enjoyed working remotely as a developer at LAMCSO/COPPE/UFRJ.\n\nCurrently, I live in Aracaju, SE, and my new goals are focused on working remotely as a developer with the LCCV/UFAL development team.', 'About Me', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '9-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-18 16:22:26', '2025-03-18 19:22:26', '', 9, 'http://localhost:8080/portfolio/wordpress/?p=246', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(247, 1, '2025-03-18 16:29:26', '2025-03-18 19:29:26', 'Front End developer with over 15 years of professional experience, based in Aracaju/SE. Vasco\'s fan, from Bahia and brazilian from heart.\n\nI was born and raised in Itabuna, a city in Bahia. When I were a child, I always dreamed of becoming an civil engineer, though I occasionally considered becoming a veterinarian. My mother wished for me to pursue a career in nursing, and over time, I thought about study in economics, management, or mathematics. However, my passion alwayes computer science, which I ultimately chose to study at university.\n\nIn April 2010, I graduated in Information Systems and moved to Rio de Janeiro, where I worked as a Front End Developer at ZONAInternet agency until November 2012.\n\nFrom December 2012 to October 2020, I had a great experience working as a Front End Developer at CENPES/Petrobras. After that, from November 2020 to March 2025, I thoroughly enjoyed working remotely as a developer at LAMCSO/COPPE/UFRJ.\n\nCurrently, I live in Aracaju, SE, and my new goals are focused on working remotely as a developer with the LCCV/UFAL development team.', 'About Me', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '9-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-18 16:29:26', '2025-03-18 19:29:26', '', 9, 'http://localhost:8080/portfolio/wordpress/?p=247', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
